n your own dry fire and live fire drills, tailoring every detail to fit your training goals. Monitor progress of a specific drill. Watch your time, hit factor, and other stats change over time. Learn what really contributes to your score, identify best shooting strategies and areas of improvement.\n\nUnlock advanced features and control your SG devices remotely.\n\nCreate custom stages on the Web with an easy-to-use interface and advanced animations. Experience them in 1:1 scale with AR preview, allowing you to make real-time adjustments before building them in real life. Export in PDF.\n\nTrain solo with Quick Stage or host a competition in Match Mode. Compete with friends, track results in real-time, and upload videos and scores automatically. View results in the app, on the web, or export to CSV.\n\nSecurely store all your stats and videos in a cloud-backed calendar, allowing easy access from any device.\n\nKeep your SG devices updated with new features and improvements.\n\nСonnect with fellow shooters, share content freely, and enjoy an ad-free, censorship-free experience.\n\n \n\nDrills includes both a free version and a subscription version with premium features.\n\nYou can subscribe and pay on the App Store, using your Apple ID. Payment will be charged to your Apple ID at confirmation of purchase. Your subscription will automatically renew unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renew may be turned off after purchase by going to the 'Manage Subscription' page in settings. The subscription will renew at the same cost.\n\nTerms of Use:  https://timer.shooters.global/terms-of-use/\n\nPrivacy Policy:  https://timer.shooters.global/privacy-policy/", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 1, "minimumOsVersion": "17.6", "userRatingCount": 1}]}